    <string name="conn_pc_title">Method A: via computer (once)</string>
    <string name="conn_pc_desc">Plug the phone into a PC with USB debugging on and run: adb tcpip 5555 . Then tap Connect and choose \"Always allow\" on the phone. Lasts until reboot.</string>
    <string name="conn_wifi_title">Method B: wireless pairing</string>
    <string name="conn_wifi_desc">1) Tap Start pairing (opens Wireless debugging). 2) Tap \"Pair device with pairing code\" and keep that dialog open. 3) Pull down the notification shade, tap \"Enter code\" and type the 6 digits (Android hides floating windows over the pairing screen). Fields below are for manual entry.</string>
