    <string name="shz_card_title">Shizuku</string>
    <string name="shz_card_desc">SysPulse uses Shizuku to read per-app CPU/RAM, GPU and FPS. Install and start Shizuku, then grant SysPulse permission.</string>
    <string name="shz_btn_open">Open Shizuku</string>
    <string name="shz_btn_download">Get Shizuku</string>
    <string name="shz_btn_grant">Grant permission</string>
    <string name="shz_guide_body">1. Install Shizuku (tap Get Shizuku).\n2. Open Shizuku and choose \"Start via Wireless debugging\": enable Developer options and Wireless debugging, tap Pairing, enter the code from the notification, then tap Start. (Or start it from a computer.)\n3. Come back here and tap Grant permission.\n4. Status turns green. Open the Processes tab in the popup.</string>
